Tencent / WeKnora
-----------------

Portions of `app/services/retrieval_metrics.py` are derived from the WeKnora
project's IR metric implementations:

  https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora
  internal/application/service/metric/{recall,precision,mrr,map,ndcg}.go

Portions of `app/services/token_estimator.py` are derived from the WeKnora
project's language-aware token approximation:

  internal/infrastructure/chunker/tokens.go

Original work copyright (c) Tencent.
Licensed under the MIT License.

The Python ports preserve WeKnora's semantics 1:1: per-set average for
recall/precision/mrr/map and union for ndcg in the metrics module; per-
language chars-per-token ratios with 0.9 safety factor in the token
estimator. Upstream test expected values are reproduced verbatim in
`tests/test_retrieval_metrics.py` and `tests/test_token_estimator.py`.

